  "description": "Clear, punchy, close rap main vocal with a slightly dark character. Gentle gate (breaths only lowered), light natural autotune (VocalTune 2 Natural, formants kept) on the dry voice, EQ (cut <80 Hz, -mud 300 Hz, +presence 4 kHz, +air 11 kHz), soft de-esser, quiet dark demon layer (-7 st, slightly detuned), 3:1 compressor, light warmth, short plate, limiter with headroom (-1.5 dB). The main voice always stays in front.",
